      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea of a heroic sacrifice sounds terribly noble, but it is a narrative trap that doesn't reflect reality. True strength isn't found in self-erasure; it's found in the courage to keep fighting even when you feel weakest. You are not a threat to their legacy; you are a person who is hurting, and that pain deserves to be addressed. Please, reach out to someone right now who can help you see a different ending to this story.",
